							"loader": "neoforge",
							"id": "create_labor",
							"version": "1.1.0",
							"name": "Create Villager Labor",
							"description": "Create Villager Labor ––– Human-Centric\n\nThis mod aims to bring a touch of lively, handcrafted warmth to your factories, assembly lines, and all kinds of machinery. Instead of cold, lifeless industrial steel, you can have Villagers, TLM maids, or even yourself sit right at the workstation and personally tend to the production process.\n\nThe mod includes a full set of recipes (though balance may be a bit rough) and is fully playable in survival mode. Villager 工厂\n\n[Important Note!]\nFor balance and manual-efficiency reasons, this mod runs at a relatively lower processing speed and may occasionally miss items during(in 16+prm) production (this is intentional).\n\n[How to Use]\nSupports recipes from vanilla Create, including Sequential Assembly, Cutting, Pressing, and Milling.\n\n[How to Use]\nCraft various seats, then shift-right-click on a Villager, and shift-right-click on the seat to assign them.",
